{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do","id":1250963,"title":"You're an exalted in Creation. What do you do?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-02T21:29:25-07:00","id":1250963,"title":"You're an exalted in Creation. What do you do?","content":"So... I've been at sufficient velocity, and the thing came up about how human rights would be a truly fascinating concept for the people there. Universal rights. Free of charge.<br /> <br /> You're an exalted in Creation. No canon characters. Anywhere. Any type. Essence 1. <br /> <br /> You have full knowledge of the setting. And any edition you choose. <br /> <br /> The question is, what goals would you choose? From marrying that pretty peasant girl, to taking over Creation, to boinking Venus, to playing the games of divinity.<br /> <br /> So... what? Like, how would act, do? And use the power?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-02T22:41:58-07:00","id":1250976,"title":"","content":"When you say no canon characters do you mean we can't be them, we don't know where they are or have any real easy access to them, or that none of them exist at all? <br /> <br /> Cause I admit if there are no canon characters my first priority is figuring out if there are now no-man's land because I have no clue what the heck the replacement might result in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-02T23:56:49-07:00","id":1250985,"title":"","content":"Statistically speaking, probably die horribly. That's how a lot of Exalts end up, and most natural Exalts don't have serious trouble with bringing themselves to so much as punch someone who is actively threatening them with a weapon, much less actually, say, kill a Wyld Hunt. I wouldn't make a great Exalt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1793-drascin","name":"Drascin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"400"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T05:50:45-07:00","id":1251034,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure Accelerator means WE can't be canon characters. Otherwise the setting would be all catty-wompus and our knowledge would be useless.<br /> <br /> I've thought of this from the position of being dumped in creation as-is. No exaltation. Also, pre- Divine Revolution. Typically, my first goal is usually to become a sorcerer. Then make as many of my friends as possible, God-Blooded; unique powers and the like. (Who wants to be Uchiha Sauske?) Then build a town around a School-Manse where I can teach sorcery. Prepare for the DR.<br /> It is a fun thought game. Although this idea is based on there being a Primordial that can bring you to creation. (Autochthon)<br /> <br /> In this case, I'd be a Lunar. I'd gain a bunch of alternate forms. Gain the ability to become Godzilla. (because; Godzilla) Become a sorcerer. Make my friends God-Bloods. Build aforementioned town. If it is in the Age of Sorrows, I'd probably place it near the Dreaming Sea and try to unite the whole area. (against the Realm, obviously)<br /> Though this could change depending on how I came to be in creation. (more to think on)<br /> <br /> I think I'd go for either edition 2.5 or 3.0(optional). Probably 3.0(optional) just because Lunars look like they may be better and I want the optional Exalted in the world. (what should we call that? 3.0(optional), 3.1?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hi, I'm Smiles With Fangs. I backed Exalted 3rd edition, but I can't make the image I have smaller so here's a kitten<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.sherv.net/cm/emoticons/cats/kitten-lick-smiley-emoticon.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> I made some Liminal Charms <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/774800-liminal-charms-creation\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> I made some Evocations for Wood Dragon's Claws <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/886214-evocations-for-spells-workshop?p=889463#post889463\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> I'm working on a splat for the Moonsilver Warriors <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/954420-the-moonsilver-warriors-peach\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8574-smileswithfangs","name":"SmilesWithFangs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8574_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T14:16:47-07:00","id":1251182,"title":"","content":"As a Water Dragonblooded I'd be tempted to attempt a Subnautica - wander out into the middle of the ocean and build a lonely home on the sea floor. Maybe I'll find some interesting things to work with. Maybe nothing but rock, seaweed and the occasional nosy shark and I'd get bored. Maybe I'd get ganked by a lunar or behemoth; who knows.<br /> <br /> I'd need an awareness charm for perceiving in the deep sea, though, or else stick to shallow waters. Craft, Athletics, Awareness, Stealth, Survival and maybe Brawl and a bit of Medicine. Long-term goal of building really nice things, short-term goals of survival and mapping out my surroundings. Demesnes would be great finds, though maybe not immediately useful, depending on their exact nature and what skills I start with (demesne/manse/geomancy rules when?).<br /> <br /> Larceny's signature water charm would be nice, if kinda far out of my way. A linguistics or socialize charm for speaking clearly underwater could be helpful; I wouldn't be the only intelligent life on the sea floor, after all, even if the region is sparsely populated. Lunars, other Waterblooded and the occasional god or god-blooded come to mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6893-drazhya","name":"Drazhya","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T14:35:16-07:00","id":1251189,"title":"","content":"I write a scroll addressed to Kejak, let him know that I have unauthorized access to a whole bunch of Creation threatening secrets and apparently a Sidereal Exaltation, that I have discovered a serious causality error, and that I request immediate extraction.<br /> <br /> Then I burn it and pray to Nara-O that there's somebody in the bureau with the charms to speak English.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T15:01:47-07:00","id":1251193,"title":"","content":"Whatever I feel like I wanna do. Gosh!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T15:43:44-07:00","id":1251203,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s interesting to consider how it might work for an Alchemical. How exactly did my soul get to Autochthonia and either get flagged as being Heroic or reincarnated enough times in enough heroic people to qualify?<br /> <br /> Either way, waking up in the vats with memories from Earth and from previous Autochthonian nations would be a hell of a trip.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T16:06:28-07:00","id":1251213,"title":"","content":"Hide. Most probably.<br /> <br /> Now, assuming Solar, if I had more courage than I do, probably avoid anything that looks like trying to engineer a modern day society, out of general suspicion for large scale social engineering (so proclamations of universal human rights that aren't even well accepted by the mass of WEIRD country 21st centurians, and a bit dubious to apply in a practical sense, backed up by my armies, are out!).<br /> <br /> Settle for trying to emulate the lives of great moral and intellectual teachers and great artists that lived in pre-20th century, pre-Great Enrichment societies and who moved their societies forward without every taking power in any way. That's Shakespeare, Hokusai, Master Kong, etc. - people who I tend to see as living pretty meaningful lives that ultimately changed how their societies and all humanity sees humanity and the world for the better, in general. Steal and appropriate liberally from actual existing Earth art and intellectual traditions to do so, even 20th century ones.<br /> <br /> Probably try smuggle a lot of historical economics / cliodynamic insights and some basic classical economics (Smith, Ricardo) into what I do to try and push forward social development on a wide scale (in a creepy psychohistorian kind of way), without actually explicitly trying to reshape society in ways that involve taking power and authority and then coercion or indoctrination.<br /> <br /> Where I'm interested in spreading inventions, focus on spreading the two &quot;greats&quot; that Creation seems to maybe lack and which are clearly as technically possible in Creation (as crossbows!) - paper (at least in some regions) and the Gutenberg metal moveable type screw printing press (everywhere?). Contributing individually is great, but I'd gamble having the mass of mortals gain more literacy, more ability to express their thoughts and form this culture of applied arts and sciences will do more for human welfare than any single great Exalt. Probably introducing better systems of basic arithmetic, place notation, etc. could do a lot. (Salina thought big on helping mortals, but perhaps let's start small with basic literacy and numeracy and getting most people out of the Malthusian subsistence farmer business, before we think about Solar Sorcery?)<br /> <br /> Assuming I've got the Exaltation enhanced skills to do this! Eclipse or Twilight are about the only Solar Exalted I'd be close to seeing as reasonably desirable to be.<br /> <br /> (Other Exalted types, something like the above, but more constrained by the lesser scale of their abilities, and the need to do what keeps happy faction bosses who are orders of magnitude more ruthless and charismatic than I can ever imagine myself.)<br /> <br /> Generally, invest a lot in defensive and running away skills that keep me from dying despite being a horrible coward. Probably die, nonetheless, from attracting bad attention from every other kind of Exalted that would nevertheless see me as a threat. I'd make a pretty horrible actual kung fu demigod!<br /> <br /> Hmm.... to be honest now I think about it, a me that would Exaltable in Creation is sufficiently different from me that it's a hard question to answer. Even the above is based on probably an *very* unrealistically idealised version of my self conception and knowledge base, and really more of a &quot;How could someone from Earth best make the Age of Sorrows Creation a better place, if they had the power of a Solar Exalt?&quot;, leaning heavily on what is unambiguously possible (and not subject to &quot;Oh, steam power / electricity just doesn't work in Creation I'm afraid!&quot;), rather than anything too linked to my actual knowledge base and skills as a person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T18:21:26-07:00","id":1251251,"title":"","content":"I'd probably want to be a Solar Exalt, though I suppose a Sidereal or possibly even a Lunar would be pretty cool too. If I had full knowledge of the setting, I think my goal would be to cure the Great Curse because that's kind of the root of a whole lot of problems for a whole lot of people. So I'd learn Stealth and Athletics Charms ASAP so I could hopefully avoid getting ganked - if your enemies can't find you or catch you, then they probably can't kill you.<br /> <br /> After that I'd try to make contact with the Gold Faction and then try to explain to Ayesha Ura what was going on. She's fairly focused on her goals but I think she'd also be able to see the bigger picture and realize how important getting rid of Limit Break would be if she wants to rebuild the First Age or make something better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T18:59:02-07:00","id":1251258,"title":"","content":"So if its me but Exalted (Solar, Lunar, or DB would all be fine), that should include the above average stats to make ir by without too much trouble to start. If i went Lunar I'd probably get lost collecting animal forms for a few years, if Solar or DB, getting a nice posse of friends/flunkies and keeping my little corner of Creation safe would be nice. Probably challenged often, but nice.<br /> <br /> I do know with in world knowledge, i would go very heavy on defenses of every sort. Just too much out there that can kill you","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24220-cryo-seraph","name":"Cryo-Seraph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T21:02:08-07:00","id":1251270,"title":"","content":"I'd go for a No-Moon Lunar and, after getting Sorcery from the person who tattooed me, I'd prolly go and try to start a sanitary movement somewhere or find a city that had one and then go work as a craftsman and creator of minor wonders, while I experimented with seeing which parts of my engineering background actually made sense in Creation. Most of the &quot;Minor Life Improvement&quot; artifacts are rank 2 or 3 and similar &quot;Life Improvement&quot; Workings should be on the terrestrial scale, so, as long as I can get my hands on Jade through my business, it shouldn't be too hard to build a big Winterbreath Jar, Thousand Comforts Lounge, summon some elementals for housework and air conditioning/heating, and so on.<br /> <br /> Starting a printing company would be a good idea too, because I'm going to get hungry for books. I know the Realm has wood block printing, so it shouldn't be too hard to upgrade that to full moveable type printing. Well, or summon some Cannibal Bureaucrat Demons to take dictation and serve as living printing presses, though feeding them might be an issue (since they eat books and paperwork).<br /> <br /> I suppose a Twilight Solar would work too, but I like shapeshifting and, if I screw up and a Wyld Hunt comes after me, I think it's easier for a Lunar to escape them. If they have any prior warning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T13:59:19-07:00","id":1251485,"title":"","content":"Creation is an extremely dangerous place. If it looks anything like 2e mechanics, I look to get my ability to defend myself cheaply and reliably up quickly. If 3e... I both have more leeway there, and less surety, which means I probably go for the second step directly: oddly, a social build with a secondary in crafts/sciences. I then seek somewhere on the hinterlands, away from Realm and Immaculate influence, and help the folks there build up against the dangers of being isolated humans in the middle of Nowhere, Creation. And seek to gain allies. Not mind-slaves, not ridiculously loyal followers spreading my will...just people who know and trust me, and who would not care if it came out that I was &quot;Anathema.&quot; This will be crucial to developing my defenses against eventual Immaculate discovery and Wyld Hunts.<br /> <br /> From there, my goal would be development of tech that mortals could use and maintain, as well as creature comforts for myself. I do want wealth and power, but I want it to be...quiet...in its build. My predillections probably attract a Twilight Exaltation, though I wouldn't turn down any and Eclipse is one of my favorite.<br /> <br /> I probably work to drive up my Integrity, too, because I could always use more of a work ethic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/827-segev","name":"Segev","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1001"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T19:37:18-07:00","id":1251541,"title":"","content":"I assume that &quot;being an Exalt&quot; also means I have the body and mind of someone who WOULD Exalt. Otherwise I'm a clueless rube wandering about with godlike power until the Wyld Hunt smokes me,<br /> <br /> But, those conditions met? Bureaucracy Supernal Eclipse, please. I don't even have to show up to end slavery and stop wars, I just have to know which organization is doing what kind of evil (which I do - I have full knowledge of the setting) and throw Foul Air of Argument and Indolent Official Charm at 'em until they can't.<br /> <br /> My other hobbies include Occult, Presence, Awareness, Investigation and Lore. My control spell is Infallible Messenger, but I also have Silent Words of Dreams and Nightmares, and Demon of the First Circle.<br /> <br /> I'm unfucking this world from the comfort of my hidden First Age manse under Charioscuro (because again, full knowledge of the setting). Step one is informing The Guild that supernatural sabotage will continue until their morals improve.<br /> <br /> I don't need to establish a Creation-spanning organization devoted to feeding the hungry, educating the ignorant and giving charity to the destitute, I just need to reform and guide the one that's already there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T21:40:36-07:00","id":1251564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1251189#post1251189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I write a scroll addressed to Kejak, let him know that I have unauthorized access to a whole bunch of Creation threatening secrets and apparently a Sidereal Exaltation, that I have discovered a serious causality error, and that I request immediate extraction.<br /> <br /> Then I burn it and pray to Nara-O that there's somebody in the bureau with the charms to speak English.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you Exalt as a Sidereal, they'll come to collect you, since they'll have been tracking you for long before your actual moment of exaltation (although that brings up the issue that it's not really possible to be an Isekai Sidereal barring some weird shenanigans, since you were born outside of fate and therefore can't be fated to Exalt from birth - IIRC Autochthonians can never be Sidereals, for similar reasons, while Lunars and Solars can start appearing there as soon as the seal is open. Of course, if someone was writing rules for Exalted Isekai stories they'd probably come up with a loophole to allow Sidereals somehow.)<br /> <br /> But regardless, yes, my first step would probably be to direct prayers to several deities trying to inform them of important things I know about the setting (the Great Curse, the Infernal Exalted, the crisis in Autochthonia and the potential that it will contact Creation soon, etc.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T02:59:47-07:00","id":1251595,"title":"","content":"I can pick any type of Exalt and be anywhere in Creation? Okay.<br /> <br /> I'm a Chosen of the Maiden of Secrets in the Sidereal-secured portion of the compound around Yu-Shan Gate 1 on the Imperial Mountain.<br /> <br /> The theme of the initial info-dump (once we figure out communication as necessary) is &quot;The Neverborn and their agents are behind every major problem you've ever had to deal with, Chejop Kejak.&quot; &quot;The dying Neverborn pronounced a Great Curse. The effects of that curse are . . . and were what made the Usurpation necessary.&quot; &quot;The Neverborn took thirteen of the Solar ghosts from the Usurpation and made them into the Deathlords.&quot; &quot;The Deathlords caused the Great Contagion.&quot; &quot;The Deathlords' agents broke open the Jade Prison and stole about half the Solars. About a hundred are now Deathknights, serving the Deathlords, and about fifty have been handed over to the Yozis to make Green Sun Princes.&quot;<br /> <br /> Then I go through my new-Sidereal-training in relative comfort and safety (compared to anybody who went Solar or Lunar, at least) while we find out what strange knowledge of mine usefully illuminates things already known in the Forbidding Manse of Ivy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/572-verzio","name":"Verzio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar572_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T09:45:58-07:00","id":1251689,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna date Demetheus, nobody in Creation can stop me from doing that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T15:24:22-07:00","id":1251774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1251689#post1251689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm gonna date Demetheus, nobody in Creation can stop me from doing that.</div> </div> </div> </div>C... can Demetheus?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T16:39:39-07:00","id":1251787,"title":"","content":"I would set about trying to get attached to the Bureau of Heaven and set about properly examining precisely how much bureaucracy it actually needs. Possibly get in an epic throw down with Ryzala in the process.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T17:51:49-07:00","id":1251798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1251774#post1251774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">C... can Demetheus?</div> </div> </div> </div>This was my question also.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/370-oriares","name":"Oriares","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar370_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T06:00:17-07:00","id":1251894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1251774#post1251774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">C... can Demetheus?</div> </div> </div> </div>That won't be a problem since there is no way he can resist an Exalted version me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T07:26:23-07:00","id":1251909,"title":"","content":"Except for being a young Lunar instead of an Elder Lich, my plans would probably be rather like Momonga from Overlord.<br /> <br /> Explore carefully. Make allies. Test powers extensively. Verify assumptions.<br /> <br /> Edit to add: after figuring out how things work, I think I'd shift from Momonga mode to Ernesti Echevalier mode and push the limits of Charms, shapeshifting, tattoos, and sorcery with audacious scientific glee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":6192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","user":"Simon Darkstep","date":".  Added a second objective. Heh. 09-07-2018, 10:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T11:53:49-07:00","id":1251967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1251894#post1251894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That won't be a problem since there is no way he can resist an Exalted version me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel afraid for him now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T12:55:15-07:00","id":1251984,"title":"","content":"I think my answer to the original question would entirely depend on how much lore knowlegde of the game I'm taking with me... like, are we saying the &quot;right now&quot; RL me zapped into creation and exalted? Because I would meta-game the crap out of everything, to the point that the Maiden of Secrets would probably appear and tell me &quot;Dude, stop screwing up the plot&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-07T14:02:14-07:00","id":1252341,"title":"","content":"as an infernal exalted I'm going to hang out in malfeas while working on my essence and knowledge base learning from the 3rd circles and fetich souls of the Yozi until I am ready to invoke the devil tiger charm lines, at that point I move to creation to build the legend that will become my own primordial, something that might be interesting, I may be able to take advantage of the Geas on the gods in heaven, so once I become a Primal Exalt I may be able to take advantage of it, if not then I would wait until I had the power to survive the wyld and go make my own world or work towards improving creation itself","signature":"","edited":{"userid":359,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","user":"Dezeroth","date":". 09-07-2018, 05:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-07T14:52:19-07:00","id":1252361,"title":"","content":"I'd go looking for a relatively isolated piece of creation, away from the major threats, and then try and transform it into my own version of an utopia","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11671-dramaflo","name":"DraMaFlo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11671_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T18:11:22-07:00","id":1252636,"title":"","content":"How much of the secret locations and hooks revealed in 2E no longer exist in 3E?<br /> <br /> If it was the 2nd Edition then I would go find a particular Deathlord to sponsor me as an Abyssal Exalt and then work towards redemption.<br /> <br /> Otherwise I'd either look at usurping the Perfect of Paragon or making my way to White Wall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/15.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2104-tenkage","name":"Tenkage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T19:27:57-07:00","id":1252642,"title":"","content":"I'm really impressed that most of you would not become power tripping id monsters. <br /> <br /> I would totally be a power tripping id monster though. Sex, Drugs, Vigilantism, hedonism... and that;s just the first week, before I learn Sun Karate and mass persuasion. By the end of month one, I'd be hip deep in Neomah and Erymanthoi and have taken over several local gangs, eating figs off of a plate held by nubile servants women while getting heretical texts tattoo'd on my divinely sculpted body (in what, I imagine, looks like sanskrit). There would be no king but I, whose burning name means Conquest and whose breath is desire and whose tears are the rains of the spring. The Bull Slayer and the Wall Breaker, master of the Bronze Skin and 80 Perfect Strikes. Wyld Hunt? Amateur Hour. I'd have pacts and deals with so many players that moving on me would be like shooting an Archduke. Assassins throw down their weapons at my beauty and armies split before my glare. I am the Chosen of the Sun, and mine is the right to Rule and Declare and Take. My deeds will make the poets cry and stir the hearts of bold men, and my death, when it comes, will be a glorious death, embraced eagerly, like the ocean breaking the levees. And my Legend will be told for a hundred times a hundred generations. <br /> <br /> Get on my level, other posters. Dream Big.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T23:32:32-07:00","id":1252682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1252642#post1252642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By the end of month one, I'd be hip deep in Neomah and Erymanthoi and have taken over several local gangs, eating figs off of a plate held by nubile servants women while getting heretical texts tattoo'd on my divinely sculpted body (in what, I imagine, looks like sanskrit).</div> </div> </div> </div>You have all the figs served by nubile women you like, man. I'm still taking the job as one of the Secret Masters of All in the place where, according to 1e Sids, the &quot;ordinary food and drink are better than anything most mortals ever taste&quot;, &quot;intoxicants more potent and exotic than any ever known in Creation can be found in any tavern&quot;, and there are &quot;brothels offering services far more exotic than any found in Creation&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/572-verzio","name":"Verzio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar572_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-09T00:24:53-07:00","id":1252690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Verzio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1252682#post1252682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You have all the figs served by nubile women you like, man. I'm still taking the job as one of the Secret Masters of All in the place where, according to 1e Sids, the &amp;quot;ordinary food and drink are better than anything most mortals ever taste&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;intoxicants more potent and exotic than any ever known in Creation can be found in any tavern&amp;quot;, and there are &amp;quot;brothels offering services far more exotic than any found in Creation&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Some men are born to serve.<br /> <br /> There's no wine, no food that matches the glory of conquest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-10T07:01:34-07:00","id":1253044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1252642#post1252642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...<br /> <br /> Get on my level, other posters. Dream Big.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ruling stuff is like work though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-10T07:56:44-07:00","id":1253056,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Simon Darkstep</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1253044#post1253044\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ruling stuff is like work though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have legitimately never understood why anyone would even want to conquer the world. Even blowing it up makes more sense to my mind as a kind of tantrum thing at unfairness or something. But it feels like after being rich enough for a country or so, further conquering is just not going to bring you any noticeable change in lifestyle. You're just adding work for yourself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1793-drascin","name":"Drascin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"400"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-10T08:07:51-07:00","id":1253061,"title":"","content":"If I was an Exalted there be so much I would like to do, really it depends on the type of Exalted.<br /> <br /> The one that makes more sense would be going with Solar. I think my biggest interest would be Sorcery, that be fun. Especially since Solars can become God Kings from their mastery with it, tho there already kinda God Kings with out it, with it I can literally create and design any I can dream of.<br /> <br /> Limit would be a bitch tho, and maybe get me kill. Hopefully I can figure out a way to deal with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-11T01:20:46-07:00","id":1253230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Drascin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1253056#post1253056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have legitimately never understood why anyone would even want to conquer the world. Even blowing it up makes more sense to my mind as a kind of tantrum thing at unfairness or something. But it feels like after being rich enough for a country or so, further conquering is just not going to bring you any noticeable change in lifestyle. You're just adding work for yourself.</div> </div> </div> </div>It really does a wonder on &quot;keeping people from conquering you first&quot; though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-11T20:50:25-07:00","id":1253469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Drascin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1253056#post1253056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have legitimately never understood why anyone would even want to conquer the world. Even blowing it up makes more sense to my mind as a kind of tantrum thing at unfairness or something. But it feels like after being rich enough for a country or so, further conquering is just not going to bring you any noticeable change in lifestyle. You're just adding work for yourself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Delegate. Ruling the world doesn't mean you have to do a bunch of paperwork and make hard decisions, it means you get to decide who does a bunch of paperwork and make hard decisions.<br /> <br /> &quot;Emperor of Creation&quot; is just another way of saying, &quot;nobody who matters disagrees that he can do whatever he wants,&quot; which is pretty nice. If you stop at one country, other countries will be full of mean people with sharpened sticks who want you to go away.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2223-ketrus","name":"Ketrus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"398"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-11T21:04:09-07:00","id":1253471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1252690#post1252690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm really impressed that most of you would not become power tripping id monsters.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, I kind've would,. Granted, for altruistic reasons, and with subtlety, but I'm still using Solar Bureaucracy and a network of spies to assure nothing that displeases me comes to pass, and tormenting my enemies in their dreams until they submit to my will, all without anybody ever seeing me.<br /> <br /> An origami bird just flitted onto my terrace and unfolded into a letter. It says &quot;STAY IN YOUR LANE, BITCH&quot; and is signed by some rube named Ketchup Carjack or somethin'. Anybody know who that is?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-11T21:17:41-07:00","id":1253475,"title":"","content":"Teach everyone the truth about creation, the Incarna, and the Yozis. Fortell great prophesies, enlighten the masses, I\u2019d earn their love, loyalty, and inspire a passion for learning and enlightenment through that education. Then I\u2019d go LARPing with the Raksha. I\u2019d also learn some bad ass sorcery and martial arts. I\u2019d build a manse somewhere nice. I\u2019d do something about the five score fellowship and the great misunderstanding. And maybe quest to find my Lunar mate, just to like tell them I\u2019d be interested in being friends or just you know tell them the door is open. Yeeep. It\u2019s be a nice century or two of effort.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T14:24:31-07:00","id":1253705,"title":"","content":"Am I the only one who would voluntarily be an Infernal? I would abuse the shit out of my position as a Prince of Hell to roll around in sadomasochistic pleasure until I get tired of that (give me a couple years) or until my Yozi &quot;master&quot; got annoying about wanting me to free them from Hell or some shit, and then I'd go to Creation and pretend to be freeing them from Hell while still indulging in every idle whim. Eventually, someone would come along and try to stop me, and I'd either have to kill them, convert them, or surrender to them in a way that makes me seem important enough to keep alive, all the while working to backstab them to death and take their shit. Rinse and repeat.<br /> <br /> I'm... probably not a very good person, given power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>DrLoveMonkey - &quot;On the other hand having a warhammer that's basically a steel beer keg on the end of a seven foot pole is fucking awesome.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9453-octopoid","name":"Octopoid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"424"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T14:47:45-07:00","id":1253712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octopoid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1253705#post1253705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Am I the only one who would voluntarily be an Infernal? I would abuse the shit out of my position as a Prince of Hell to roll around in sadomasochistic pleasure until I get tired of that (give me a couple years) or until my Yozi &quot;master&quot; got annoying about wanting me to free them from Hell or some shit, and then I'd go to Creation and pretend to be freeing them from Hell while still indulging in every idle whim. Eventually, someone would come along and try to stop me, and I'd either have to kill them, convert them, or surrender to them in a way that makes me seem important enough to keep alive, all the while working to backstab them to death and take their shit. Rinse and repeat.<br /> <br /> I'm... probably not a very good person, given power.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd want to know about 3rd editions infernals. That Yozi decided motivation that can just be used to beat you over the head is a bit of a deterrent to me as well as the annual meetings. Otherwise yeah I'd have loads of fun with some of the infernal abilities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-13T01:07:22-07:00","id":1253826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ketrus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250963-you-re-an-exalted-in-creation-what-do-you-do?p=1253469#post1253469\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Delegate. Ruling the world doesn't mean you have to do a bunch of paperwork and make hard decisions, it means you get to decide who does a bunch of paperwork and make hard decisions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ruler of the world is not an ontological state; it's a constant struggle against people who want to replace you. Either you do the work necessary to keep the position against usurpers, or you wind up a slowly-cooling corpse on the floor of the palace of the new ruler of the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/572-verzio","name":"Verzio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar572_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}